rem Roots on the Rise
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=479

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option N integer = 1000000

rem The three roots give (a_k - b_k)
rem (b_k - c_k) (c_k - a_k) = 1 - k^2
rem = u, so S is the sum of the
rem geometric series u + .. + u^N =
rem u (u^N - 1) / (u - 1), u - 1 =
rem -k^2.
Md = 1000000007
K = (1 to N) copy
U = (1 - K * K) mod Md
Un = U N Md powmod
Iv = (K * K mod Md) (Md - 2) Md powmod
T = U * (1 - Un) mod Md * Iv mod Md
Answer = T sum mod Md
Answer print
